    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d178-f1" n="5" type="source" xml:id="d178-f1-content">
                <p>Secret; Nodis. The source text bears no drafting information.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d178-f2" n="6" xml:id="d178-f2-content">
                <p>No record of the meeting with the President on June 23 has been found. Rusk’s
                    Appointment Book notes that he, Ball, and Acheson attended from the Department
                    of State. (Johnson Library)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
